Package: SpThreshold
Type: Package
Title: Replication Threshold for Bayesian Multilevel Models of Areal Data
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-17
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shuqi", "Lin", email = "shuqi.lin@yale.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4016-0029")),
    person("Joshua L.", "Warren", email = "joshua.warren@yale.edu",
           role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6274-6970")))
Description: Fits Bayesian multilevel models with Leroux spatial or
    independent Gaussian random effects for Gaussian, Bernoulli, binomial
    and negative binomial outcomes. Provides conditional posterior variance
    comparisons and replication threshold calculations for Gaussian outcomes,
    including a leading-order approximation and a numerical threshold.
    Summarizes posterior means, variances and intervals directly from MCMC
    draws. Sampling is implemented in C++ via RcppArmadillo, with Polya-Gamma
    augmentation from pgdraw for binary and count outcomes.
License: GPL-3
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.13), pgdraw (>= 1.1)
